# Keep the image to the code it needs. Without this the build context is the
# whole checkout: your sessions, uploads and settings would be baked into the
# image, and bridge/node_modules would be copied over the container's own with
# Windows binaries.
**/node_modules
.git
.gitattributes
.gitignore
pi-desktop
uploads
workspace
*.log
*.tmp
webui-settings.json
last-session.json
agent-source.txt
.env
.env.*
bridge/whisper
README.md
